{
  "name": "MUSE \u00b7 Delegate Connectors (AXIOM-gated targets)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1000,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## MUSE \u00b7 Delegate Connectors \u2014 outbound targets\nEach connector is a webhook the **delegate** hop calls following the `N8nBridge` contract:\n`POST /webhook/muse-connector-<name>  { idempotency_key, verified_by, payload }` + `Idempotency-Key` header.\n\n**Reached only AFTER the AXIOM gate approves.** Idempotency guard dedupes retries. Replace each **NoOp** with the real Gmail/Slack node + credentials \u2014 connecting a 3rd-party account is **owner-gated**.",
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1364273a-5a61-469f-9038-084f33984594",
      "name": "h",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -260
      ]
    },
